  "tokens": 144,
  "cover_text": "In a small bowl, combine fennel, capers, Dijon mustard, juice of one lime, and 2 Tbsp. dried thyme. Season with salt and pepper. Refrigerate until ready to use. To bake, butter two gallon pots, place one on a 13x20\" metal baking sheet, and the other on a 10x15\" baking sheet. Spray both pans with PAM. Bake in dessicated oil at 375°F (190°C) until crust is golden and paprika is easily edible when you lightly scrape a piece off the crust,酥皮面包y.\n4 smells the same, or maybe it's just an abundance of fruit!We take pride in maintaining a price point",
